kyverno-namespace-exec-block/kyverno-block-pod-exec-by-namespace.yaml:ClusterPolicy/deny-exec-in-vault-namespacekyverno-namespace-exec-block/kyverno-block-pod-exec-by-namespace.yamlkubernetesfalse1-36

